message: "If you use PulseShift, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PulseShift: Calibrated Forecasting of Weather-Driven Mobility Suppression and Hourly Identification of Air-Quality Effects"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-17
url: "https://github.com/urmeo/PulseShift"
repository-code: "https://github.com/urmeo/PulseShift"
license: MIT
